{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_47135060636744a5988b3c6ae2688930","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_423afbe7c3e8e5e16b5c63dfd6ae774cbc021b5bd6c4a0ed80035309168e2a1d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"zachblume/autospec@e379edd427fc snapshot 7239b7163f559e68","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_593f3fbb9c4f3f947684e88920ceca7e19e8f31e9039b880e07f9cc93ea13630"],"source_ids":["src_0ea1f3d67f1959c184d32da0ebffc190"],"text":"It uses vision and language models to judge the whole UI after each interaction, deciding correctness rather than checking regressions against rigid prior behavior.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_47135060636744a5988b3c6ae2688930"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_47135060636744a5988b3c6ae2688930","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_51a6020f9f0bd713804dbbcc5f90d1eb6764bf03293e95db5132f4e8324061b1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"zachblume/autospec@e379edd427fc snapshot 7239b7163f559e68","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d81d5bd074685550ec801b58323febf6bdf02325e9ea761f5e4dc4321c1cd3d"],"source_ids":["src_0ea1f3d67f1959c184d32da0ebffc190"],"text":"The workflow has three phases: plan (crawl up to 3 pages, capture accessibility snapshots, generate specs), execute (specs run in parallel in isolated browser contexts), and report.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_47135060636744a5988b3c6ae2688930"}
